Transmuting the Paragon's Hammer with a Mark of Fate, which is combined from five Heavenly Souls dropped in the heroic [[Library of Fate]], consumes three charges to add the following bonuses:
{{Center|{{Lines|{{Color|Green|Unlocks Mastery Skill: Paragon of Fate}}|{{Color|Green|(Keep in inventory to gain bonus)}}|{{Color|Gold|Level 133}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + Heavenly Soul + 50000 Gold = Library of Fate 133 scroll</nowiki>|{{Color|Gold|Level 136}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + 2 Heavenly Souls + 100000 Gold = Library of Fate 136 scroll</nowiki>|{{Color|Gold|Level 139}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + 3 Heavenly Souls + 150000 Gold = Library of Fate 139 scroll</nowiki>}}}}

Transmuting the Paragon's Hammer with a Mark of Sanctity, which is obtained by transmuting the Demonsbane with five sacred unique items, consumes three charges to add the following bonuses:
{{Center|{{Lines|{{Color|Green|Unlocks Mastery Skill: Paragon of Sanctity}}|{{Color|Green|(Keep in inventory to gain bonus)}}|{{Color|Gold|Level 130}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + 4 (8) Sacred Uniques = 1 (2) Sacred Essence</nowiki>|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + Any Sacred Unique + 100000 Gold = Duncraig 130 scroll</nowiki>|{{Color|Gold|Level 134}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + Sacred Essence + 200000 Gold = Duncraig 134 scroll</nowiki>|{{Color|Gold|Level 139}}|<nowiki>Transmute: Paragon's Hammer + 2 Sacred Essence + 300000 Gold = Duncraig 139 scroll</nowiki>}}}}

Following the instructions will consume the gold and other items to create a Scroll of Summoning to the mentioned heroic rifts. The Paragon's Hammer is never consumed by these recipes.

The final upgrade to the Paragon's Hammer can be applied by killing [[the Justicar]], boss of the final heroic version of the Library of Fate, within 7 minutes of entering, and transmuting the Paragon's Hammer in the Horadric Cube:
{{Center|{{Color|Blue|+1% to Maximum Elemental Resists if you have at least 36 affixesfrom Rare/Crafted/Magic items}}}}

