==Dúlra Aegis==
Located in four distant corners of [[Scosglen]] are the four [[Protected Chest]]s, each of which drops a Scroll when destroyed. After all four Scrolls have been collected, they can be combined into the Dúlra Aegis item design.
{{Item
|img =durlaaegis.jpg 
|name = Dúlra Aegis
|color = Yellow
|base = {{Lines|Item Design|||Cube with separate Ingredients to Design|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Conflict}}|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Judgement}}|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Wisdom}}|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Vigor}}|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Restraint}}|{{Color|Red|Tenet of Harmony}}}}
}}

The Corrupted Druids scattered around Scosglen have a 20% chance to drop the corresponding Tenet design and a 1% chance to drop the corresponding full Tenet. Each type of Corrupted Druid corresponds to one Tenet: [[Corrupted Hunter]] (Tenet of Conflict), [[Corrupted Naturist]] (Tenet of Harmony), [[Corrupted Seer]] (Tenet of Wisdom), [[Corrupted Werebear]] (Tenet of Restraint), [[Corrupted Wereowl]] (Tenet of Vigor) and [[Corrupted Werewolf]] (Tenet of Judgement). Each Tenet design lists the items needed to transform it into the full Tenet: two [[Corrupted Crystal]]s, three [[Arcane Crystal]]s, one [[Signets|Greater Signet of Learning]], and three other ingredients:
{| class="va-table va-table-full sortable"
!Tenet
!Specific Ingredients
|-
|Tenet of Conflict
|{{Lines|Neutrality Pact|3 [[Mystic Orb|Unique Mystic Orbs]]|3 Sacred Unique Boots}}
|-
|Tenet of Judgement
|{{Lines|Xazax's Illusion|25 Shrines|3 Sacred Unique Gloves}}
|-
|Tenet of Wisdom
|{{Lines|Ghost Trance|Relic|3 Sacred Unique Belts}}
|-
|Tenet of Vigor
|{{Lines|Books of Kalan|5 Enchanted Runes|3 Sacred Unique Body Armors}}
|-
|Tenet of Restraint
|{{Lines|The Sleep|Emblem|3 Unique Amulets}}
|-
|Tenet of Harmony
|{{Lines|Weather Control|4 Large Cycles|3 Unique Rings}}
|}
Note that a Tenet design must be transmuted with one ingredient at a time (which will turn the colour of said ingredient on the item description from red to green), not all at once. After all requirements have been satisfied, transmuting the Tenet design with [[Cube Reagents|Oil of Craft]] and 300 thousand gold will result in the full Tenet. When the Dúlra Aegis has been combined with all six Tenets (like the previous step, it must be done one Tenet at a time), it will turn into the full charm.

