The '''Corrupted Abbey''', referred to as '''Duncraig''' in its heroic versions, is a Nephalem Rift located in the city of [[Duncraig]] which dominates the city's eastern half. It is notable for being the source of [[Assur's Bane]], a unique ring that provides [[Purify]], a required skill when facing certain uberbosses.

Spread around the Corrupted Abbey are the five [[Emissary of Assur|Emissaries of Assur]]. Each drops his own demon seal, while the normal [[Slain Soul]]s and [[Necromorb]]s have a chance to drop the unique [[Ring of the Five]]. Combining the Ring of the Five and the five demon seals creates Assur's Bane, the sole source of the skill Purify, which is required to deal damage to certain uberbosses, including [[Assur's Avatar]], the boss of the Corrupted Abbey itself, which drops the [[charms|charm]] Demonsbane.

Duncraig has four Heroic versions. In order to access the first three Heroic versions, one needs to upgrade the Paragon's Hammer from [[Kurast 3000 BA]] with a Mark of Sanctity, which is created by transmuting Demonsbane with five sacred unique items, to unlock the [[Paragon of Sanctity]] skill. With one point put into this skill, transmuting the Paragon's Hammer with one sacred unique item, one Sacred Essence or two Sacred Essences and 100000, 200000 or 300000 gold creates a Scroll of Summoning for level 130, 134 and 139 respectively. The Paragon's Hammer is not consumed by the recipe.
