The level 139 version is home to Assur's five lieutenants [[Bonehexer]], [[Eyegouger]], [[Mindflayer]], [[Skinrender]] and [[Spinecracker]]. Each drops his own trophy; combining any four of them creates the Scroll of Summoning for the fourth and final Heroic version, called '''Assur's Realm'''.

The minibosses also drop a Sacred Essence when killed. Each miniboss has a unique drop, with around 2% drop rate.
* Bonehexer: [[Bonehexer's Puzzlebox]]; a Relic to reroll unwanted relics at 4:1 ratio.
* Eyegouger: ??
* Skinrender: Skinrender's Ear; Relic that grants Magic resist and life regen in Heroic Duncraig.
* Spinecracker: ??
* Mindflayer: [[Mindflayer's Mirror]] which can make base unique boots copying SU helm stats.

