Pulsating Worldstone Shard.text:
The '''Pulsating Worldstone Shard''' is dropped by [[Baal]] on [[Difficulty Levels|Destruction difficulty]]. It is the key leading to the uber boss [[Samael, Herald of the End]].

{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|As you touch the crystal your mind is filled with fractured memories from long ago|{{Color|DarkGray|"...and that is why neither of our brethren will find us here. We will forge a new world and our children will know peace."}}|{{Color|Yellow|*Transmute*}}}}
}}

Once put inside the [[Horadric Cube]] and transmuted (with no other items), the description will change to the following (in this order):

{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|{{Color|DarkGray|"A Sanctuary, forevermore. Free from the Eternal Conflict and the dangers beyond the Veil."}}|{{Color|DarkGray|"The Veil? Inarius surely you haven't succumbed to Itherael's prophecies... nothing more than an attempt to explain the unfathomable."}}|{{Color|Yellow|*Transmute*}}}}
}}


{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|{{Color|DarkGray|"The Stone has been, is, and will be the axis of our worlds. What came before is irrelevant!"}}|{{Color|DarkGray|"Lillith... the High Heavens, Burning Hells, Sanctuary. These worlds, dimensions, are but a grain of sand in the universe."}}|{{Color|Yellow|*Transmute*}}}}
}}


{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|{{Color|DarkGray|"There are many more worlds than those upon which we have stood. The Worldstone has existed since the Dawn of Time and kept us safe in the sea of possibilities, yet we can't be sure what lurks just beyond our understanding."}}|{{Color|Yellow|*Transmute*}}}}
}}


{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|{{Color|DarkGray|...}}|{{Color|DarkGray|"Lillith... the High Heavens, Burning Hells, Sanctuary. These worlds, dimensions, are but a grain of sand in the universe."}}|The destruction of the Worldstone has not only exposed Sanctuary to the direct influence of Heaven and Hell. It has exposed to us all to an even greater threat.|
This shard is the key, its full potential must be unlocked.|{{Color|Yellow|*Transmute*}}}}
}}


{{Item
|img = 
|name = Pulsating Worldstone Shard
|color = Unique
|base = {{Lines|It which screams haunt the living|It which can manifest their son and his disciple|It which is of the brother, savior and sacrifice|It which is of many and may cleanse the soul|It which is the splinter of the spirit in a land Unformed}}
}}

At this point, the Pulsating Worldstone Shard must be transmuted with the following [[charms]] and unique items:
* The Sleep
* Ring of Virtue (completed [[The Void]] ring)
* Neutrality Pact
