Transmuting the Pulsating Worldstone Crystal with a [[Signets|Greater Signet of Learning]] will create a Dimensional Link, which opens a portal to the [[Edge of Nothingness]], Samael's lair, if used in Act 5 Hell difficulty. The Pulsating Worldstone Crystal itself is '''not''' consumed by this recipe.
