Protected Chest.text:
Four Protected Chests can be found in [[Scosglen]]. You will find the first in the top part of the map. When destroyed, these chests drop a scroll, explaining the story and leading towards the next chest.
[[File:Protected Chest 1.png|100px|right|framed|The first protected chest is very much visible]]
==Scroll Text==
{{Spoilertable|id=Scroll1|text=You've made it here... I've left this note hidden here hoping that a worthy hero would find it. We need to stop the Uileloscadh Mór, the Lord of Destruction is almost finished corrupting all of Scosglen, and soon all of Sanctuary...<br>Over centuries, Druids have been mastering the art of the Dubhdroiacht, this allows them to control the forces of nature. This place was the fortress for their greatest creation of all: the Dulra Catalyst. We need to stop Baal before he finishes it.<br>Please look for my diary, it's in the farms... Look for a chest near a hut, and you'll find it.|title=Click to Show Scroll 1}}
{{Spoilertable|id=Scroll2|text=This device allows him to control any living creature, including yourself... thankfully assembling it is far from easy. But this doesn't mean we have a lot of time. The catalyst was never completed because its threat to mankind, and the instructions were split to multiple Túr Dúlra experts that swore to protect them.<br>Baal has corrupted almost all of them by now, after taking the information he needed. He's hidden in the fortress, but you can't see him. He has used the catalyst to shape a different dimension to protect him. Making our own Catalyst is our best attempt at defeating him.<br>The second part of the diary is in a chest in the Praying Temple. It's east of to the Farms.|title=Click to Show Scroll 2}}
{{Spoilertable|id=Scroll3|text=To build the catalyst, we will need the instructions. These can be read in the Ancient Circle at the Fortress, however only the quantities are there. Obtain the knowledge tomes by defeating the corrupted Druids, but remember only a handful have them. The complete tome will list the necessary ingredients to create the Catalyst.<br>Once you have obtained all tomes, look for the next diary in a hut close to the entrance.|title=Click to Show Scroll 3}}
{{Spoilertable|id=Scroll4|text=The tomes can be restored by transmuting them together in your horadric cube. But only an expert druid can decypher the instructions. If you aren't one, you'll have to also combine my three diaries, I've imbued power in them which should suffice.<br>Once you have the catalyst, go to the Ancient Circle and use it to enter Baal's dimension. Beware as he has control over nature and climate, it will not be pleasant.<br>It is now time for the worst. Prepare.|title=Click to Show Scroll 4}}

